# liteDS-v2 input script - DEMO for the --input-script feature.
# Shrek Smash n' Crash Racing auto-advances its intro logos into the main
# menu by ~frame 860 (Single Player highlighted). This script presses A to
# confirm, advancing to the "SELECT GAME TYPE" submenu. Compared against a
# no-script run at the same frame count, the framebuffer hash diverges,
# proving scripted input reaches emulation deterministically.
#
# Format: "<frame> <keys>" holds exactly those keys from that frame onward.
# Keys: A B SELECT START RIGHT LEFT UP DOWN R L X Y | NONE | 0x<hex pressed-mask>
920 A
930 NONE
